  <AltText>
    Artfight attack of 'Ayn el-Mal'ak from LovelyWings. 'Ayn is a bibically accurate angel with many red, blue, green, and purple eyes. They also have six white angel wings. Between the bottom two wings is the text 'Be Not Afraid', but with 'Not' crossed out. LovelyWings' signature is along the bottom purple eyes, between the bottom two wings.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    Alternatively named 'Salt Time'.
    I thought this design was super cool, I love it alot!!
    I hope you like it! :bluehearthug:
